{
  "version": 1,
  "_note": "市场情绪:恐惧贪婪指数(alternative.me,日更)+ BTC 市值占比 + 总市值 24h 变化(CoinGecko)。",
  "i18n": {
    "zh-CN": {
      "noData": "暂时取不到情绪指数"
    },
    "en-US": {
      "noData": "Fear & Greed unavailable"
    }
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "action": "concurrent",
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "request",
          "id": "f",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.alternative.me/fng/?limit=2",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json"
          }
        },
        {
          "action": "request",
          "id": "g",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.coingecko.com/api/v3/global",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "fv",
        "value": "$[get::(index::(${f.data},0),value)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${fv}),0),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "${@i18n.noData}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "主干 = 恐惧贪婪读数;CoinGecko 那半边是增强,挂了只让两个小格显示 --。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "yv",
        "value": "$[get::(index::(${f.data},1),value)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "band",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${fv},25),0,if::(lt::(${fv},45),1,if::(le::(${fv},55),2,if::(lt::(${fv},75),3,4))))]"
      },
      "_note": "分档与 alternative.me 自己的五档一致(0–24 / 25–44 / 45–55 / 56–74 / 75–100)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "gx",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(calc::(3+${fv}/100*128.0),0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "gxa",
        "value": "$[calc::(${gx}-0.01)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "btcD",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${g.data.market_cap_percentage.btc},0.0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mc",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${g.data.market_cap_change_percentage_24h_usd},0.00)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mcUp",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${mc}),0),if::(ge::(${mc},0),1,0),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mcFl",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${mc}),0),if::(lt::(calc::(${mc}*${mc}),0.000025),1,0),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mcTA",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${mc},0),${mc},calc::(0-${mc}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mcTF",
        "value": "$[if::(ne::(findNotEmpty::(${mc},__none__),__none__),parseNumber::(${mcTA},0.00),)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mcT",
        "value": "$[if::(ne::(findNotEmpty::(${mc},__none__),__none__),if::(eq::(${mcTF},0),connect::(${mcTF},%),connect::(if::(gt::(${mc},0),+,−),${mcTF},%)),--)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "at",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},HH:mm)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "resultFilter",
      "params": {
        "keys": [
          "fv",
          "yv",
          "band",
          "gx",
          "gxa",
          "btcD",
          "mcT",
          "mcUp",
          "mcFl",
          "at"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
